{"review_id": "ch13-s05-v1-independent-r1", "unit_id": "ch13-s05", "version_id": "ch13-s05-v1", "review_type": "independent-reader", "artifact_sha256": "b18c1c636f57c797c28ecb70086e7f74d0299131e110c1a93a9278cec233246e", "review_path": "C:/Users/Administrator/Documents/Codex/2026-07-27/new-chat/outputs/capital-volume1-de-zh-new/chapters/ch13s05/reviews/ch13s05-independent-r1.md", "review_sha256": "a6eb462d11b2df789dabcda7a2e8c9313aa4fcee5301833f142386fe36b4b270", "reviewer_context": "/root/ch13s05_independent_r1", "source_access": false, "verdict": "PASS", "review_attempt": 1, "review_note": "终稿仍有一处数据关系可能误读：纺纱车间减少三分之一的对象原文只明确写“支出”，当前中文可能被理解为“支出和人手”都减少。 终稿另有五处一遍阅读障碍：“多少……多大程度”对应生硬；“技术过高”含义不明；“越不断进步”句法冲突；“也就是……收入”关系不清；“低等级的劳动／熟练劳动”把人抽象成劳动。；终稿把内斯密因1851年长期大罢工而改进机器写成“罢工以后”，把原文的因果关系弱化成了时间先后。", "created_at": "2026-07-29T02:45:53.250563+00:00"}
{"review_id": "ch13-s03-v1-independent-r1", "unit_id": "ch13-s03", "version_id": "ch13-s03-v1", "review_type": "independent-reader", "artifact_sha256": "a0b2654885d109176aafbbeca0a721f71cf89f6b6f8fc523f3f47616e933c044", "review_path": "C:/Users/Administrator/Documents/Codex/2026-07-27/new-chat/outputs/capital-volume1-de-zh-new/chapters/ch13s03/reviews/ch13s03-independent-r1.md", "review_sha256": "fab7720dacd246dd878edd8212cb99fb34809aa56570bd86f8eb01701a64ef38", "reviewer_context": "/root/ch13s03_independent_r1", "source_access": false, "verdict": "PASS", "review_attempt": 1, "review_note": "终稿仍有两处一遍阅读障碍：“资本主义生产的精神”没有落到具体行为；末句“把妇女和儿童加入队伍”搭配生硬，随后又以多层定语压缩男工抵抗的主体、场景和动作。；终轮盲读仍有四处阻断：两处抽象或多层修饰需要回读；蒸汽机节省动力与带动更重设备的因果未说清；末句“使缩短了两小时的工作日”句法悬空。保留本轮精确稿件，待人工审定，不再自动开启r4。；终轮盲读仍有两处阻断：脚注178所说的“上述两个十一年时期”无法与正文时段对应；丝织业表格同一行由磅改为码但没有说明单位变化。保留本轮精确稿件，待人工审定，不再自动开启r4。", "created_at": "2026-07-29T04:04:06.948393+00:00"}
{"review_id": "ch13-s06-v1-independent-r1", "unit_id": "ch13-s06", "version_id": "ch13-s06-v1", "review_type": "independent-reader", "artifact_sha256": "cea120f5c319894ab2d5b3e511584d47d3751afc7eac1479d8fbe3642cee28d2", "review_path": "C:/Users/Administrator/Documents/Codex/2026-07-27/new-chat/outputs/capital-volume1-de-zh-new/chapters/ch13s06/reviews/ch13s06-independent-r1.md", "review_sha256": "7f2d0a7df5e950de1721c333b3ea6e6cb67d0a772499c386d2a490a93fa0be3a", "reviewer_context": "/root/ch13s06_independent_r1", "source_access": false, "verdict": "FAIL", "review_attempt": 1, "review_note": "整节盲审发现两处新的一遍阅读障碍，但都落在已完成两次返工的r3任务中：一处无法判断被“释放”的是工人、工资还是工资资本；另一处把资本主义用法造成的问题写成既不存在又来自资本主义用法，因果自相冲突。按有限审核规则不再生成r4。", "created_at": "2026-07-29T04:23:42.273484+00:00"}
{"review_id": "ch13-s01-v1-independent-r1", "unit_id": "ch13-s01", "version_id": "ch13-s01-v1", "review_type": "independent-reader", "artifact_sha256": "18c19fdb546d9971d230148dd72c9c3fcb0e43bfc46b59b8d0f02225009daae5", "review_path": "C:/Users/Administrator/Documents/Codex/2026-07-27/new-chat/outputs/capital-volume1-de-zh-new/chapters/ch13s01/reviews/ch13-s01-independent-r1.md", "review_sha256": "7aa98d880409c3af155025aa8fba482b438c1699245a4cef7db10002e0e7155e", "reviewer_context": "/root/ch13s01_independent_r1", "source_access": false, "verdict": "PASS", "review_attempt": 1, "review_note": "两处终审问题：alle 被弱化为“通常”，海上航行被缩窄为远洋航行。；走锭纺纱机段落的“当时”时间指向含混，没有明确保留写作当时精细纺纱仍需人工回车。", "created_at": "2026-07-29T05:14:25.834353+00:00"}
